"EUR-Lex - 62020CJ0724 - EN - EUR-Lex (https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A62020CJ0724)\nciteturn5view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A62020CJ0724\",\"lineno\":267}); Redirected to URL: https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:62020CJ0724; Total lines: 520\nL0: [Input] [Input]\nL1: \nL2: cite0†Skip to main content L3: \nL4: cite1†My EUR-Lex L5: \nL6: cite1†English L7: \nL8: Select your language\nL9: \nL10: * * *\nL11: \nL12: Official EU languages:\nL13: \nL14: [Input]\nL15:   * cite1†bgбългарски L16:   * cite1†esEspañol L17:   * cite1†csČeština L18:   * cite1†daDansk L19:   * cite1†deDeutsch L20:   * cite1†etEesti keel L21:   * cite1†elΕλληνικά L22:   * cite1†enEnglish L23:   * cite1†frFrançais L24:   * cite1†gaGaeilge L25:   * cite1†hrHrvatski L26:   * cite1†itItaliano L27:   * cite1†lvLatviešu valoda L28:   * cite1†ltLietuvių kalba L29:   * cite1†huMagyar L30:   * cite1†mtMalti L31:   * cite1†nlNederlands L32:   * cite1†plPolski L33:   * cite1†ptPortuguês L34:   * cite1†roRomână L35:   * cite1†skSlovenčina L36:   * cite1†slSlovenščina L37:   * cite1†fiSuomi L38:   * cite1†svSvenska L39: [Input]\nL40: \nL41: cite2†EUR-Lex L42: \nL43: Access to European Union law\nL44: [Input] [Input]\nL45: \nL46: cite1†<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/content/help/eurlex-content/experimental-features.html\" target=\"_blank\">More about the experimental features corner</a> [Input]\nL47: \nL48: [Input]\nL49: \nL50: [Input] [Input]\nL51: ##### Choose the experimental features you want to try\nL52: \nL53: * * *\nL54: \nL55: Do you want to help improving EUR-Lex ? This is a list of experimental features that you can enable. These features are still under development; they are not fully tested, and might reduce EUR-Lex stability. Don't forget to give your feedback!\nL56:   *     * [Input][Input] Replacement of CELEX identifiers by short titles - experimental feature. It replaces clickable CELEX identifiers of treaties and case-law by short titles.\nL57:     * [Input][Input] Visualisation of document relationships. It displays a dynamic graph with relations between the act and related documents. It is currently only available for legal acts.\nL58:   *     * [Input][Input] Deep linking. It enables links to other legal acts referred to within the documents. It is currently only available for documents smaller than 900 KB.\nL59: [Button: Apply ]\nL60: \nL61: [Input]\nL62: \nL63: cite3†Image L64: \nL65: EUR-Lex\nL66: \nL67: Access to European Union law\nL68: \nL69: This document is an excerpt from the EUR-Lex website\nL70: \nL71: EU law\nL72:   * cite1†Treaties L73:     * cite4†Treaties currently in force L74:     * cite5†Founding Treaties L75:     * cite6†Accession Treaties L76:     * cite7†Other treaties and protocols L77:     * cite8†Chronological overview L78:   * cite9†Legal acts L79:   * cite10†Consolidated texts L80:   * cite11†International agreements L81:   * cite12†Preparatory documents L82:   * cite13†EFTA documents L83:   * cite14†Lawmaking procedures L84:   * cite15†Summaries of EU legislation L85:   * cite1†Browse by EU institutions L86:     * cite16†European Parliament L87:     * cite17†European Council L88:     * cite18†Council of the European Union L89:     * cite19†European Commission L90:     * cite20†Court of Justice of the European Union L91:     * cite21†European Central Bank L92:     * cite22†European Court of Auditors L93:     * cite23†European Economic and Social Committee L94:     * cite24†European Committee of the Regions L95:   * cite25†Browse by EuroVoc L96: EU case-law\nL97: \nL98:   * cite26†Case-law L99:   * cite27†Reports of cases L100:   * cite28†Directory of case-law L101: \nL102: Official